 1 Ports        3 │ Tap · goreleaser · a new version of a Go tool, like dehv
 2 Branches     2 │  [goreleaser]  cask   formula   t next
 3 Profiles       │
 4 Skills         │  In the repo · <name>
 5 Walls          │   1 raise the version: CHANGELOG, and VERSION if it has one
 6 Machine        │     git commit -am "<name> <version>" && git push
 7 Tap            │   2 tag it: the release workflow builds it and updates the tap
 8 Doctor       ✓ │ ▌   git tag v<version> && git push origin v<version>
                  │   3 watch it
                  │     gh run watch
                  │
                  │  On this Mac
                  │   4 check it
                  │     brew update && brew upgrade de-hv/tap/<name>
                  │     <name> --version
                  │
                  │
